        { "t": "text", "v": "Domain weights convert directly into questions — " },
        { "t": "strong", "v": "1% ≈ 0.6 questions of the 60" },
        { "t": "text", "v": " — so study time should follow the same curve. Domains 1 + 2 together are " },
        { "t": "strong", "v": "45% of the exam" },
        { "t": "text", "v": ", and Domain 1 alone outweighs every other domain." }
      ]
    },
